#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-configure.rst:5 076fc576bae249c5b3c4eb692324b50c
msgid "Configuration and Setup"
msgstr "配置与设置"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-configure.rst:7 17d4ba1161244f929efa35d778d0d0bb
msgid ""
"All sailing parameters can be found by searching for the prefix  :ref:`SAIL "
"<SAIL_ENABLE>`, the sailing code relies heavily on getting correct "
"information on the wind direction and strength from the :ref:`wind vane "
"<wind-vane>`."
msgstr ""
"所有帆船参数均可通过搜索前缀 :ref:`SAIL <SAIL_ENABLE>` 找到，帆船代码在很大程度上依赖于从 :ref:`风速传感器 "
"<wind-vane>` 获取正确的风向和风速信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-configure.rst:12
#: 1f5f6532269f49de8d3e30e519c6b600
msgid "Other useful parameters"
msgstr "其他有用参数"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-configure.rst:13
#: d307e39bebea4d979ac1da53546829be
msgid ""
":ref:`SAIL_NO_GO_ANGLE <SAIL_NO_GO_ANGLE>` defines the no go zone into witch"
" the sailing vehicle cannot travel. In auto heading modes the vehicle will "
"tack at this angle into the true wind If the desired heading is within the "
"no go zone. Note: this angle will be used whatever the wind strength and "
"should be set with that in mind."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SAIL_NO_GO_ANGLE <SAIL_NO_GO_ANGLE>` "
"定义帆船无法行驶的禁区。在自动航向模式下，若目标航向位于禁区内，帆船将在此角度相对于真风方向进行抢风换舷。注意：无论风速如何，该角度均有效，设置时需考虑这一点。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-configure.rst:18
#: db491790f2f74b40807acf4fba479402
msgid ""
"``WP_OVERSHOOT`` defines the maximum cross track error in auto mode that is "
"allowed before the vehicle will tack. This keeps the vehicle within a "
"corridor of width 2* :ref:`SAIL_XTRACK_MAX<SAIL_XTRACK_MAX>`. If set to zero"
" the vehicle will ignore the cross track error and only tack once it can "
"reach its destination."
msgstr ""
"``WP_OVERSHOOT`` 定义自动模式下允许的最大横向偏差，超过此值将触发抢风换舷。这将使帆船保持在宽度为 2 倍 "
":ref:`SAIL_XTRACK_MAX<SAIL_XTRACK_MAX>` 的通道内。若设为零，帆船将忽略横向偏差，仅在能直接到达目的地时才换舷。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-configure.rst:22
#: c621f05e54234b8bac211cc2b7de1dc9
msgid ""
":ref:`PIVOT_TURN_RATE <PIVOT_TURN_RATE>` defines the maximum rate used for "
"tacking, a lower value will result in slower tack. This should be reduced if"
" the vehicle is tacking too sharply and losing momentum while tacking."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PIVOT_TURN_RATE <PIVOT_TURN_RATE>` "
"定义抢风换舷使用的最大速率，较低的值将导致换舷更慢。若帆船换舷过猛导致失速，应降低此值。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-configure.rst:25
#: 52b27f4d6e0c474a86e97664b259bbf0
msgid ""
":ref:`LOIT_RADIUS <LOIT_RADIUS>` defines the radius from the loiter point "
"the vehicle will try and stay within, the vehicle will keep moving and tack "
"back towards the loiter point once it reaches this radius."
msgstr ""
":ref:`LOIT_RADIUS <LOIT_RADIUS>` 定义帆船尝试保持在 Loiter "
"点周围的半径，帆船将持续移动，到达该半径后抢风换舷返回 Loiter 点。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-configure.rst:28
#: b60bb4b63b4b497d8ab02b9741300b3b
msgid ""
":ref:`SAIL_HEEL_MAX <SAIL_HEEL_MAX>` defines the angle at which the sail "
"heel control PID controller is enabled. If the heel is larger than this "
"angle the PID controller will target this angle however if the heel is less "
"the controller will not try and reach it. i.e. only sheet out, don't sheet "
"in."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SAIL_HEEL_MAX <SAIL_HEEL_MAX>` 定义启用船体横倾控制 PID 控制器的横倾角度。若横倾大于此角度，PID "
"控制器将以此角度为目标；若横倾小于此角度，控制器不会尝试达到该角度。即只放帆，不收帆。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-configure.rst:32
#: b67128541f294dc2b96ef29e993a3a0e
msgid ""
"Heel control PIDs values are set using ``ATC_SAIL_x`` parameters. The effect"
" of changing the value can be seen in ACRO mode by manually heeling the "
"vehicle. Most control should be done using the P "
"(:ref:`ATC_SAIL_P<ATC_SAIL_P>`) and I(:ref:`ATC_SAIL_I<ATC_SAIL_I>`)terms. D"
" gain (:ref:`ATC_SAIL_D<ATC_SAIL_D>`) is usually too quick for the "
"relatively slow response of the sail winch servos so should be left at zero."
" The PID values can be sent via Mavlink using :ref:`GCS_PID_MASK "
"<GCS_PID_MASK>`."
msgstr ""
"横倾控制 PID 值使用 ``ATC_SAIL_x`` 参数设置。在 Acro 模式下手动使帆船横倾，可以观察更改数值的效果。大部分控制应通过 P "
"项（:ref:`ATC_SAIL_P<ATC_SAIL_P>`）和 I 项（:ref:`ATC_SAIL_I<ATC_SAIL_I>`）完成。D "
"增益（:ref:`ATC_SAIL_D<ATC_SAIL_D>`）通常对帆面绞盘舵机响应较慢，因此应保留为零。PID 值可通过 Mavlink 使用 "
":ref:`GCS_PID_MASK <GCS_PID_MASK>` 发送。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-configure.rst:37
#: f6b38b9d390f4657a89887916cb01329
msgid ""
"Tacking in ACRO and AUTO mode while traveling upwind can be triggered "
"through the use of an aux switch. This can be setup by setting the "
"``RCx_OPTION`` parameter to function 63 – sailboat tack."
msgstr ""
"在 Acro 和 Auto 模式下逆风行驶时，可通过辅助开关触发抢风换舷。可通过将 ``RCx_OPTION`` 参数设为功能 63（帆船换舷）来设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-configure.rst:41
#: ab2003215121410d94882cc9919c4f03
msgid "Tuning"
msgstr "调参"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-configure.rst:43
#: 563cedf3e69f4402b647fbbfe1f9dcf3
msgid ""
"The steering rate and navigation should be tuned in the usual way. Care "
"should be taken that the final parameters work well on all points of sail "
"and at range of wind speeds. For tuning the navigation controller it is "
"recommended that a simple two point mission is run. The mission should be "
"set up such that the boat travels at 90 degrees to the wind. This can be run"
" indefinitely using a do_jump waypoint. Note that the L1 controller is only "
"used when the vehicle is not tacking close to the wind."
msgstr ""
"转向速率和导航应按常规方式调节。需注意最终参数在各种帆位和不同风速下均能良好工作。对于导航控制器的调参，建议运行一个简单的两点任务，任务应设置为帆船与风向成"
" 90 度行驶，可使用 do_jump 航点无限循环运行。注意 L1 控制器仅在帆船不进行逆风抢风换舷时使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-configure.rst:49
#: 628ce5dea557432fb42ff6f03fc267aa
msgid ""
"If the vehicle aggressively responds to changes in wind direction when "
"traveling upwind either the wind vane direction filter frequency can be "
"reduced or the maximum straight line rate reduced. Note that reducing the "
"filter frequency will also slow the response of the sails."
msgstr "若帆船在逆风行驶时对风向变化响应过于激烈，可降低风速传感器方向滤波频率或降低最大直线速率。注意降低滤波频率也会减慢帆的响应速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-configure.rst:53
#: bfe67a28d03d451cbe288b562dab76bf
msgid ""
"The heel angle controller can be setup in two ways. A low I term "
"(:ref:`ATC_SAIL_I<ATC_SAIL_I>`) can be used with a low max heel angle. In "
"this case the controller will never hold at the max heel angle but will "
"progressively sheet out as heel is increased. Alternatively the heel angle "
"(:ref:`SAIL_HEEL_MAX <SAIL_HEEL_MAX>`) can be set at the actual maximum "
"desired heel and then higher gains used to more aggressively let the sails "
"out. In this case larger I and I max values should be used. Unlike the P and"
" I terms the D term is always active however due to the slow response of "
"typical sail winch servos it is unlikely to prove useful, vehicles with "
"faster servos may benefit from a small amount of D gain."
msgstr ""
"横倾角控制器可有两种设置方式。一是使用较低的 I "
"项（:ref:`ATC_SAIL_I<ATC_SAIL_I>`）配合较低的最大横倾角，此时控制器不会保持在最大横倾角，而是随横倾增加逐渐放帆。另一种是将横倾角（:ref:`SAIL_HEEL_MAX"
" <SAIL_HEEL_MAX>`）设为实际最大期望横倾角，然后使用更高增益更积极地放帆，此时应使用较大的 I 和 I 最大值。与 P 和 I "
"项不同，D 项始终有效，但由于典型帆面绞盘舵机响应较慢，D 增益作用不大；响应较快的舵机可能从少量 D 增益中受益。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-configure.rst:61
#: 33672e4e70cd4d3b921caf7001925177
msgid "Fences"
msgstr "围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-configure.rst:63
#: 4c412f2211d243249cd9c02f8544b078
msgid ""
"Sailboats behave in the same manner as other Rovers regarding fence "
"operation and breach failsafe actions. However, unlike other Rovers, which "
"slow as they approach a fence boundary, Sailboats will just attempt to tack "
"away from the boundary since they have no speed controller, as such."
msgstr ""
"帆船在围栏操作和越界失控保护动作方面与其他 Rover 行为相同。然而，与接近围栏边界时减速的其他 Rover "
"不同，帆船没有速度控制器，因此只会尝试通过抢风换舷远离边界。"
